howto.bench_press':'Lie flat on the bench, grip the bar slightly wider than shoulders. Lower it to mid-chest with control, then press up explosively. Keep shoulder blades pinched and feet planted.','lift.howto.squat':'Bar on upper traps, feet shoulder-width apart. Hips back and down until thighs are parallel to the floor. Drive through the heels and keep your chest up.','lift.howto.deadlift':'Bar over mid-foot, hinge at hips to grip, brace the core hard. Stand tall by pushing the floor away. Keep the bar close to the body.','lift.howto.shoulder_press':'Seated or standing, press the bar or dumbbells straight overhead. Stop just short of lockout. Keep ribs down, no arched back.','lift.howto.pullup':'Hang from the bar with a wide grip. Pull your chest toward the bar, driving elbows down. Lower with control \u2014 no swinging.','lift.howto.bicep_curl':'Elbows pinned to your sides, curl the weight up by flexing the biceps \u2014 no swinging. Squeeze at the top, lower slowly.','lift.howto.incline_bench':'Bench set to 30-45\xb0. Same technique as flat bench \u2014 focuses on the upper chest and front delts.','lift.howto.dumbbell_row':'Hand and knee on bench, hinge at hips. Row the dumbbell to your hip, squeezing the shoulder blade. Control the negative.','lift.howto.barbell_row':'Bent-over torso at ~45\xb0, pull the bar to your lower chest/belly. Keep elbows close to the body, don\'t round the back.','lift.howto.lat_pulldown':'Grip the bar wide. Pull it down to your upper chest, driving elbows down and back. Squeeze lats at the bottom.','lift.howto.leg_press':'Feet shoulder-width on the platform. Lower until knees reach 90\xb0, then press back without locking the knees.','lift.howto.lunges':'Step forward, lowering the back knee nearly to the floor. Front knee over ankle. Push through the front heel to return.','lift.howto.romanian_dl':'Soft knees, hinge at the hips keeping the bar close to your legs. Stop at mid-shin, feel the hamstring stretch, then stand up.','lift.howto.tricep_dips':'On parallel bars, lower until elbows hit 90\xb0. Press back up by extending the triceps. Keep chest slightly forward for chest, upright for triceps.','lift.howto.tricep_pushdown':'Cable from top, elbows pinned at sides. Extend arms fully, squeeze triceps, return slow.','lift.howto.hammer_curl':'Neutral grip (palms facing in), curl dumbbells up. Targets brachialis and forearms along with biceps.','lift.howto.preacher_curl':'Upper arm fully on the pad. Curl the bar with strict form, especially controlling the negative. No bouncing.','lift.howto.lateral_raise':'Slight bend in the elbows. Raise dumbbells out to shoulder height, pinky slightly up. Don\'t use momentum.','lift.howto.front_raise':'Raise the dumbbell straight in front to shoulder height. Slow descent. Alternate or both arms together.','lift.howto.face_pull':'Rope attachment at face height. Pull to your face with elbows high and wide. Excellent for rear delts and posture.','lift.howto.chest_fly':'On a bench, slight bend in elbows locked. Arc the dumbbells apart, then squeeze them back across your chest.','lift.howto.cable_crossover':'Stand between cables, slight forward lean. Bring hands together in front of the chest. Squeeze hard at peak.','lift.howto.calf_raise':'Standing on a step, rise high on your toes, full stretch at the bottom, peak contraction at the top. Slow and controlled.','lift.howto.leg_curl':'Prone or seated machine. Curl heels toward your glutes, squeezing the hamstrings. Slow down.','lift.howto.leg_extension':'Seated, extend the knees to full lockout. Pause 1 second at the top, lower slowly. Targets quads.','lift.howto.hip_thrust':'Upper back on the bench, bar over your hips. Drive hips up forcefully, squeeze glutes hard at the top, chin tucked.','lift.howto.bulgarian_split':'Rear foot elevated on a bench. Lower into a deep lunge on the front leg. Keep the torso upright.','lift.howto.plank':'Forearms on the floor, body in a straight line from head to heels. Brace the abs and glutes. Breathe.','lift.howto.crunches':'Lie on your back, feet flat. Lift shoulder blades off the floor (not a full sit-up). Exhale on contraction.','lift.howto.russian_twist':'Seated, lean back 45\xb0, feet up. Rotate side to side touching the floor or a weight next to your hip.','lift.howto.hanging_knee':'Hang from a pull-up bar. Raise your knees up toward your chest. Lower with control, no swinging.','result.burned':'Your workout burned','result.log_workout':'Log Workout','manual.title':'Manual Entry','manual.subtitle':'Log calories burned for any activity.','manual.what_did':'What activity did you do?','manual.activity_ph':'e.g. Swimming, Boxing...','manual.calories_burned':'Calories Burned','manual.log_activity':'Log Activity','fooddb.title':'Food Database','fooddb.search_ph':'Search food (e.g. Apple, Chicken...)','fooddb.no_results':'No results found for','fooddb.keep_typing':'Keep typing to search...','logfood.title':'Log Food','logfood.food_name':'Food Name','logfood.food_name_ph':'Name of your food...','logfood.unit_ph':'Unit (e.g. g, ml, cup)','logfood.calories':'Calories','logfood.protein':'Protein','logfood.carbs':'Carbs','logfood.fat':'Fat','logfood.description':'Description','logfood.log_btn':'Log Food','logfood.logging':'Logging...','tabs.coach':'Coach','coach.title':'Your Coach','coach.adaptive_label':'ADAPTIVE DAILY TARGET','coach.real_burn':'Real burn (TDEE)','coach.weight_trend':'Weight trend','coach.confidence':'Confidence','coach.conf_low':'Building\u2026','coach.conf_medium':'Good','coach.conf_high':'High','coach.building_title':'Building your plan\u2026','coach.building_sub':'Log meals and weigh in for ~1 week and Salorie computes your REAL calorie burn from your trend \u2014 then adapts your target automatically (no guessing).','coach.days_tracked':'days tracked','coach.streak_suffix':'day streak','coach.streak_0':'Log a meal today to start your streak \ud83d\udd25','coach.streak_low':'Keep it going \u2014 momentum is everything.','coach.str